 CHARMM>    ! =====================================================================
 CHARMM>    ! 7. Generate Ions and Place Them by Exact Water-Site Conversion
 CHARMM>    ! =====================================================================
 CHARMM>    ! This replaces the broken "replace solvent" behavior.
 CHARMM>    ! For each ion atom:
 CHARMM>    !   1. choose one SOLV OH2 water oxygen,
 CHARMM>    !   2. duplicate that coordinate to one ion,
 CHARMM>    !   3. delete the full selected TIP3 water residue.
 CHARMM>    !
 CHARMM>    ! Final ion counts should exactly match:
 CHARMM>    !   SOD total = npos + nposcoion
 CHARMM>    !   CLA total = nneg + nnegcoion
 CHARMM>     
  
 CHARMM>    random uniform iseed 8675309
RANDSPEC> CLCG random number generator in use:
RANDSPEC> UNIFORM distribution will be used
